--
--   The module contains both definitions and the lemmas proved alongside them in the source. They are kept together so the transplant stays faithful and every proof is re-checked by the server.
--
--   Source: Z. Chen, A. Gohari, A. Javanmard, H. Lin, V. Mirrokni, C. Nair, D. P. Woodruff, *A Proof of the Most Informative Boolean Function Conjecture*, arXiv:2609.24931 (2026). Lean development: https://github.com/dpwoodru/general-courtade-kumar-lean (Apache-2.0), module `CKLaneA1.R5Data.C002` from release v1.0 (`sources_v3.tar.zst`).
